*   **hp (-0.60):** The 2300 GVW diesel models typically use the 1.5L Turbo D engine with 100PS (99 hp) or 130PS (128 hp) [8, 35, 42]. These power outputs are significantly below the average passenger car benchmark of 200 hp.
*   **torque (0.00):** The 100PS diesel produces 250Nm (approx 184 lb-ft) and the 130PS produces 300Nm (approx 221 lb-ft) [8, 35, 42]. These figures are around or slightly above the average benchmark of 190 lb-ft.
